{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50244","headline":"看缙云山图 · 李翔","name":"看缙云山图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谓见仙都二十年，（谓，项疑当作「未」。\n）忽逢图画顿欣然。\n云岩不似人间世，物象翻疑洞里天。\n迥压鳌头当海眼，直侵鹏路倚星躔。\n顶湖纵去无多地，空见霜流百丈泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}